Online Bookstore - Full Stack Application
Overview
This is a full-stack application for an online bookstore where users can browse books, add them to the cart, write reviews, and more. Admins can manage users, authors, and books, while authors can publish their books and see notifications about new orders.

Frontend (React, TypeScript, Bootstrap)
Technologies Used:
React (with TypeScript) for building the user interface.

Bootstrap for styling and responsive design.

Axios for making API requests to the backend.

React Context API for managing global states like authentication.

JWT Authentication to secure login/signup and manage session state.

React Router for page navigation.

React Modal for displaying login/signup forms.

