Features:
Home Page: Browse books, view featured books, filter by genres.

Login & Signup: Users can register and log in to access cart and purchase functionality.

Cart Page: Add books to cart and proceed to checkout (not fully implemented for order tracking).

Admin Dashboard: Admin can manage users, authors, and books.

Author Dashboard: Authors can publish books and see notifications.

Review System: Users can add/edit/delete reviews, with ratings.

Backend (Node.js, Express, MySQL, TypeORM, JWT)
Technologies Used:
Node.js as the runtime environment.

Express for building RESTful API endpoints.

MySQL for storing application data like books, users, and reviews.

TypeORM for database management and ORM functionality.

JWT (JSON Web Token) for user authentication.

bcryptjs for hashing user passwords.

dotenv for managing environment variables.

Cors for enabling cross-origin requests.

